	(text "NOTES\n1. CHARGE_TEMP (TP4056 TEMP) tied to GND = NTC check disabled (2-pin battery, no thermistor). I will later confirm with Wesley perhaps next meetingh (Jack what do you think?)\n2. Old main board had contact-mic J3 pins 7/8 = SCL/SDA (swapped vs. contact-mic board CDATA/CCLK). 7 = SDA, 8 = SCL."
